    "body": "[A10] READY TAKEOVER / ASSIGNMENT\n\nLive Ready status confirmed. Executor A158 (Codex), independent cleared-context internal reviewer R225 (Codex), external reviewer R226 (Opus), manager A10. A157 has finished; this takes the sole free author slot. Reviews will wait for the current round and complete validation.\n\nBranch440-markdown-closers will be created through gh issue develop from live dev b17580b91deb11f3441dfc5d7f9fafe539d929b8. Move to In progress before the first edit. Settled scope is the current issue plus decision5771170243: exact closing-fence space/tab class and literal ASCII-folded type1 closing names, any of the four ending any type1 block. Preserve the current global refusal policy and all unrelated paragraph/container behavior. #437 remains separate. No open design decision remains.\n\nAuthority: linked CommonMark4.5/4.6, CONTRIBUTING6.1, REQUIREMENTS section8, code-quality rule12, public PR428 review evidence. Validation: the full measured character/closer sweep at base and head against GitHub's renderer, raw-vs-shipped refusal/CR boundaries, per-family mutation sensitivity, unchanged tracked-page classification except enumerated directly affected corrections, TOC/em-dash/docs/idiom gates, then the complete native/replica/hosted/two-review bar. Reserve an issue440 control-family prefix; existing cases are not renumbered.\n\nNo overlap with #505's CI files or #478's builder files is expected. No workflow, ci_events, RTL, version or submodule changes belong here. Any actual conflict or newly discovered behavior is recorded publicly before scope changes.\n",
